  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来得正好！\n你也是个有本事的训练家吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655F976B63597DFF01000A4F604E5F662F4E2A6709672C4E8B76848BAD7EC35BB65427FF1F00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们也是有两下子的！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n现在的战术真是恰到好处，\n打什么样宝可梦对战都连战连胜！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E5F662F67094E244E0B5B507684FF0100100001BE01000A73B0572876846218672F771F662F60705230597D5904FF0C000A62534EC04E4868375B9D53EF68A65BF9621890FD8FDE62188FDE80DCFF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们为什么厉害？\n秘诀就在于变化招式！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E3A4EC04E4853895BB3FF1F000A79D88BC05C3157284E8E53D8531662DB5F0FFF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用变化招式\n让自己的宝可梦变强！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "752853D8531662DB5F0F000A8BA981EA5DF176845B9D53EF68A653D85F3AFF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用变化招式\n让对手的宝可梦变弱！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "752853D8531662DB5F0F000A8BA95BF9624B76845B9D53EF68A653D85F31FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战的关键并不只有造成伤害。\n来尝尝我们这种对战方式有多厉害吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF9621876845173952E5E764E0D53EA6709902062104F245BB33002000A67655C1D5C1D62114EEC8FD979CD5BF9621865B95F0F6709591A53895BB35427FF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相信你也一定能品出滋味的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F84FE14F604E5F4E005B9A80FD54C151FA6ECB54737684FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "挑战我们两个的变化招式的这份草率……\n不，这份勇气至少是值得认可的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6311621862114EEC4E244E2A768453D8531662DB5F0F76848FD94EFD8349738720262026000A4E0DFF0C8FD94EFD52C76C1481F35C11662F503C5F978BA453EF7684FF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你打算对战的话，\n准备好以后就来说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6062537B975BF9621876848BDDFF0C000A51C65907597D4EE5540E5C3167658BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要开始这场\n名为宝可梦对战的竞赛吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89815F0059CB8FD9573A000A540D4E3A5B9D53EF68A65BF9621876847ADE8D5B5417FF1F00100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开始吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F0059CB5427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我准备一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151C659074E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "变化招式的行家\n可以说是很慢热的。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我们早就习惯等待了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D8531662DB5F0F7684884C5BB6000A53EF4EE58BF4662F5F88616270ED7684300200100001BE00000A62114EEC65E95C314E6060EF7B495F854E86300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦会使用变化招式\n提升自己的能力！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A64F1A4F7F752853D8531662DB5F0F000A63D0534781EA5DF1768480FD529BFF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对战拖得越长，\n你的宝可梦就越会陷入绝境。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF9621862D65F978D8A957FFF0C000A4F6076845B9D53EF68A65C318D8A4F1A967751657EDD5883300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们两个状态超好！\n要用你来刷新一下连胜纪录咯！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1188,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E244E2A72B660018D85597DFF01000A898175284F606765523765B04E004E0B8FDE80DC7EAA5F5554AFFF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可恶！\n这下连胜纪录要中断了……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF6076FF01000A8FD94E0B8FDE80DC7EAA5F5589814E2D65AD4E8620262026FF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不，还没断呢！\n只要二人组里的我打赢，就还是连胜！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0DFF0C8FD86CA165AD5462FF01000A53EA89814E8C4EBA7EC491CC7684621162538D62FF0C5C318FD8662F8FDE80DCFF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以下一个换我上！\n我不会让你打断连胜纪录的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE54E0B4E004E2A636262114E0AFF01000A62114E0D4F1A8BA94F60625365AD8FDE80DC7EAA5F557684FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要我打赢，就还是连胜！\n快点开打吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981621162538D62FF0C5C318FD8662F8FDE80DCFF01000A5FEB70B95F0062535427FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "开打",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F0062530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我准备一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151C659074E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你是怕宝可梦的能力被削弱吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60662F60155B9D53EF68A6768480FD529B88AB524A5F315427FF1F00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦擅长用变化招式\n让对手的宝可梦能力下降！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A664C5957F752853D8531662DB5F0F000A8BA95BF9624B76845B9D53EF68A680FD529B4E0B964DFF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错，也就是说\n你无法像平常那样战斗！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF0C4E5F5C31662F8BF4000A4F6065E06CD550CF5E735E3890A3683762186597FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们是连胜二人组！\n一个人输不算是输！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC662F8FDE80DC4E8C4EBA7EC4FF01000A4E004E2A4EBA8F934E0D7B97662F8F93FF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们两个的变化招式\n竟然都不管用……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4E244E2A768453D8531662DB5F0F000A7ADF713690FD4E0D7BA1752820262026FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不论是强化自己的宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8BBA662F5F3A531681EA5DF176845B9D53EF68A62026202600100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是削弱对手的宝可梦……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F524A5F315BF9624B76845B9D53EF68A62026202600100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只靠这些都无法取胜……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA97608FD94E9B90FD65E06CD553D680DC20262026FF0100100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以请你这位宝可梦训练家\n告诉我们什么才是对战的关键吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE58BF74F608FD94F4D5B9D53EF68A68BAD7EC35BB6000A544A8BC962114EEC4EC04E48624D662F5BF9621876845173952E5417FF1F00100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相信宝可梦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F84FE15B9D53EF68A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锻炼宝可梦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "953B70BC5B9D53EF68A60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错，正是如此啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF0C6B63662F59826B64554A300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "强化也好削弱也罢，都是取胜手段，\n而不是必胜的方法。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F3A53164E5F597D524A5F314E5F7F62FF0C90FD662F53D680DC624B6BB5FF0C000A800C4E0D662F5FC580DC768465B96CD5300200100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你让我们学到了很重要的东西。\n宝可梦对战真是博大精深啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BA962114EEC5B6652304E865F8891CD898176844E1C897F3002000A5B9D53EF68A65BF96218771F662F535A59277CBE6DF1554A300200100002011401370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陌生的训练家，\n能和你对战真是太好了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĸ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "964C751F76848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A80FD548C4F605BF96218771F662F592A597D4E86FF0100100002011401380000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿,",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你让我们学到了很重要的东西。\n宝可梦对战真是博大精深啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕķ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
